a parity surface straddles it, so it belongs to the Architect and the Warden, not to a validator.\n- Recruit only when `maestri list` shows a genuine gap; prefer `maestri role assign` over duplicating teammates.\n- Match the ceremony to the task: a one-line question about the codebase you may answer yourself; a validation run goes through the loop.",
